  "doc_id": "981aa243a164434fb77f111966f81b58",
  "text": "### 7. Technology Risk Assessment  \n**Summary:**\nCTO presented technology risk assessment including cybersecurity posture and system availability.  \n**Key Risks Identified:**  \n**Risk 1: Legacy Payment System** ⚠️ **Medium Risk**\n- System is 7 years old, periodic slowness\n- Mitigation: Replacement project planned 2027\n- Status: Monitoring and optimization\n- Impact if failure: 1–2 hour payment processing delay  \n**Risk 2: Third-Party Vendor Reliance** 🟢 **Low Risk**\n- Dependent on AWS for cloud infrastructure\n- Mitigation: Multi-region backup, vendor SLAs\n- Status: Quarterly vendor reviews ongoing\n- Impact: Well-mitigated  \n**Risk 3: Cybersecurity Threat Landscape** 🟡 **Emerging**\n- Increased phishing attacks (industry-wide)\n- Mitigation: Staff training, advanced email filtering\n- Status: Monitoring external threat intelligence\n- Impact: Low (strong controls in place)  \n**Committee Decision:**\n✅ **APPROVED** technology risk assessment.  \n**Recommendation:**\n- Accelerate legacy payment system replacement (tentatively 2027 → early 2027)\n- Continue cybersecurity investment and awareness training  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 10/14",
